      "remarks": "Describes the cgep-app-starter workload as deployed by github.com/yashduttsh-oss/cgep-app-starter, plus the GRC baseline wrapped around it. Primary framework: CMMC 2.0 Level 2, which inherits NIST SP 800-171; controls cite the NIST SP 800-171 Rev 3 catalog."
